From: native port preparation
Subject: Preserve original STM terminal wait through native power removal
Upstream-base: efa6fc84680e48bfdca7e6ac245d8abf333ae617

The original caller still disables interrupts, synchronizes instruction fetch,
and waits forever until real power removal. Only native builds service that
hardware wait through the retained native STM owner. Default configuration and
hot reset remain unsupported; no source flags or callbacks are fabricated.

--- a/src/RVL_SDK/os/OSStateTM.c
+++ b/src/RVL_SDK/os/OSStateTM.c
@@ -74,6 +74,9 @@
 
     while (true)
     {
+#ifdef MSCHARGED_NATIVE
+        mscharged_stm_terminal_wait();
+#endif
         ;
     }
 }
